    <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mt-8 mb-4">
      The Utah State Tax Commission
    </h3>
    <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-4">
      The Utah State Tax Commission administers most state taxes and has broad collection authority similar to the IRS. They can file tax liens, issue levies, and garnish wages for unpaid state taxes. They also have their own appeals process and can refer cases for criminal prosecution.
    </p>

